message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it as below."
title: "AI Testing Platform (AIT): rule-based, LLM-based and hybrid REST API test generation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nguyen
    given-names: Quoc Long
    email: nguyenquoclong1@dtu.edu.vn
    affiliation: "School of Data & Artificial Intelligence, Duy Tan University, Da Nang, Vietnam"
version: "1.0-paper"
date-released: "2026-10-19"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - REST API testing
  - test generation
  - large language models
  - OpenAPI
  - seeded faults
abstract: >-
  Platform that generates, executes and evaluates REST API test cases from an OpenAPI 3.x
  specification with rule-based, LLM-based (local models) and hybrid strategies and a deterministic
  oracle, with three benchmark APIs containing 32 seeded faults and the data of the accompanying paper
  "Rules First, LLMs Second: Rule-Based, LLM-Based and Hybrid REST API Test Generation with Local
  Models and a Deterministic Oracle".
